{"id":2737,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>4月8日下午，我院在15108Z教室举办明德讲坛，本次讲坛紧贴2026年中国国际大学生创新大赛备赛需求，邀请往届获奖成员吴媛、马玉萍担任主讲，为学院学子带来一场兼具实用性与指导性的经验宣讲。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-ozlWYLzW7MNQVLHl-aLR-snzrVnmlgZLmr2UmL4M8VRM4U0gihFp2hmCIa0USyZL1yYnkhVM7r2U4CDUz-YMzVRozUDL4C8U4LPMzCsoz6FUlWkUzffn7rFnmCDL1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsLmlJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6725&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A822DE4EFC66A2251C946364C3156797/ABBA0ADE/F662\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 527px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-ozlWYLzW7MNQVLHl-aLR-snzrVnmlgZLmr2UmL4M8VRM4U0gihFp2hmCIa0USyZL1yYnkhVM7r2U4CDUz-YMzVRozUDL4C8U4LPMzCsoz6FUlWkUzffn7rFnmCDL1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsLmlJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6725&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>宣讲环节中，吴媛同学结合自身参赛经历，围绕选题打磨、材料撰写、备赛技巧等内容进行指导，针对性解答同学们备赛过程中的常见问题，为大家参赛规划提供清晰指引。马玉萍同学则聚焦赛事答辩PPT制作展开讲解，从内容排版、逻辑梳理、亮点突出等方面传授制作要点，助力同学们打磨优质参赛展示材料。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nzlWinzLYUlrVoH7L8U8UbMz9ZLz7gYLlUso7L8L7-PMz-0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDMkysL1y4nl-PUz9inzWVM4-soz-ZnNV2nRNbUzL4ozMFnNM2UzWVLmrFnzT7Lkb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsLmlJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6725&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/864723EB1A85E2E727928FAFD99A3393/FCFA2E25/E9D0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 543px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nzlWinzLYUlrVoH7L8U8UbMz9ZLz7gYLlUso7L8L7-PMz-0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDMkysL1y4nl-PUz9inzWVM4-soz-ZnNV2nRNbUzL4ozMFnNM2UzWVLmrFnzT7Lkb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsLmlJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6725&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>此次讲坛干货满满，有效解答了同学们备赛疑惑，进一步营造了学院创新创业良好氛围，助力我院学子以充足准备积极投身赛事比拼。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nmAWVM8QRnz9ZLHlr7o77sMzUZU47gbU4QkLzLZnz7aLR-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7nky4U1y4nNnfLll8L8r2MzQ7MmvDLm9snl7PUN-soRWFLRn2nzUsMzQFLzf2MRNJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDM4-igtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6725&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9DD3B3FDA1E43EF56D676287EA1BB782/04FE4756/10F49\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 533px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nmAWVM8QRnz9ZLHlr7o77sMzUZU47gbU4QkLzLZnz7aLR-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7nky4U1y4nNnfLll8L8r2MzQ7MmvDLm9snl7PUN-soRWFLRn2nzUsMzQFLzf2MRNJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDM4-igtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6725&e=.jpeg\"></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-ozlWYLzW7MNQVLHl-aLR-snzrVnmlgZLmr2UmL4M8VRM4U0gihFp2hmCIa0USyZL1yYnkhVM7r2U4CDUz-YMzVRozUDL4C8U4LPMzCsoz6FUlWkUzffn7rFnmCDL1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CsLmlJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6725&e=.jpeg"}